    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Wonder Record Shop</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a collection of rhythm mini-games, each record containing a unique and wondrous adventure. Embark on refreshing, adorable hand-drawn adventures and let your sense of rhythm bring you endless joy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511970/extras/cc6483a734b3a008c8b3dc24fe3bee5c.avif?t=1731779055\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your rhythm to tackle various challenges in these magical adventures! In different levels, you\u2019ll take on various roles with unique objectives, but they all have one thing in common: follow the beat to progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is inspired by <i>Rhythm Tengoku</i>. If you\u2019ve played it before, you\u2019ll quickly get the hang of our game as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511970/extras/7c88e810cd6c9311e31746b82378837d.avif?t=1731779055\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes at least 16 charming and quirky mini-games, taking you on a delightful and unexpected journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adorable hand-drawn art style and smooth 2D animation bring the game world to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully crafted original music in various styles, letting you immerse yourself in a sea of rhythm.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511970/extras/f9b2afa84111f373bcc5c53702ef8bde.avif?t=1731779055\" data-has-big /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Wonder Record Shop</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a collection of rhythm mini-games, each record containing a unique and wondrous adventure. Embark on refreshing, adorable hand-drawn adventures and let your sense of rhythm bring you endless joy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511970/extras/cc6483a734b3a008c8b3dc24fe3bee5c.avif?t=1731779055\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your rhythm to tackle various challenges in these magical adventures! In different levels, you\u2019ll take on various roles with unique objectives, but they all have one thing in common: follow the beat to progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is inspired by <i>Rhythm Tengoku</i>. If you\u2019ve played it before, you\u2019ll quickly get the hang of our game as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511970/extras/7c88e810cd6c9311e31746b82378837d.avif?t=1731779055\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes at least 16 charming and quirky mini-games, taking you on a delightful and unexpected journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adorable hand-drawn art style and smooth 2D animation bring the game world to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully crafted original music in various styles, letting you immerse yourself in a sea of rhythm.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511970/extras/f9b2afa84111f373bcc5c53702ef8bde.avif?t=1731779055\" data-has-big /></span></p>",
